<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Zakali</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zakali Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zakali</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zkl</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zakali</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">GALA gooiti Zakali ti woni, naati ka ti sɛʋɛi nii zu. Zakali ná-eteai ziɛni ta é ɠɛni GALA gooi wosu yeeɠɛɠala ɠilagi zu ta Azé. Naama yeeɠɛɠalai ɠɛni ga siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠaleni ma la, ti ɠulani la duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne. Ʋelei nɔ Azé kɛɛni la, tɔ ɓalaa é Izilayɛle nui iɲɔdɔɔni ga ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ɠaaɓela (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 8:9">8:9</ref></char>). Zakali zɔlɔɔni zalaɠa ɠula ʋɛlɛyeɠei ta wu, kɛɛɠɛ Ido laaseigi ɠa zalaɠa ɠula nuiti daaseigiti saama, niiti ti ɠaleni ma, ti zeɠe Ɓaɓilɔne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NEH 12:4">Neɠ 12:4</ref></char>). Zakali ná-GALA gooiti boni kona undɔɔlugɔ puufelegɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta unnaanigɔ puulɔsaʋai (520-480), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zakali Izilayɛle nuiti iɲɔdɔɔni ga ti ɠaaɠale ma GALA pɔ, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA ɓalaa ge ɠaaɠale ma ti ʋɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 1:3">1:3</ref></char>). Zakali ná-GALA gooiti su, kulakɛlɛma lɔsaʋa ɠa ti zaama, niiti é ti zɔlɔɔni kpidi ɠila daawu. Naati ti ʋilɛni fai tanigaa ʋa, niiti ti ɓeni niina ga ɠɛ. Naa ʋoluma Zakali faawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ ɓɔɛ felegɔ woni, é lo Izilayɛle ná-undaanɛ vai ʋa, nii é ʋaazu. Faawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ ɓɔɛi naati ta Mesi ʋaa vai zuɠulazu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">9:9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Zakali ta ná-keela wooiti dɛɛ vai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 1:1-6">1:1-6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Zakali ná-kulakɛlɛma lɔsaʋaiti, é ti zɔlɔɔni kpidi ɠila daawu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 1:7-6:8">1:7—6:8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Zalaɠa ɠula losuʋɛ ná veai Zozuwe ya, ta zu so fai Izilayɛle (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 6:9-8:23">6:9—8:23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Faawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ ɓɔɛ felegɔ é lo Mesi ʋa, ta GALA ná-masadai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:1-14:21">9:1—14:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1"/>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-toligi é bosu ga Izilayɛle nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1"/>Masagi Daliyuse ná-masadai ma ɠonagi velesiɛi, ma alu dɔsaʋasiɛi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Zakali ʋɔ, Ɓelekia ná-doun zunui, Ido ná-doun zunui ɓalaa ɠɛni de, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ZEC 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wola yiiɠaawanani wo-mɛmɛwolani ma. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3"/>Ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹À ɠale ma, wo ʋa pɔ̀,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. « ‹Nà ɓalaa nà ɠale ma wo ʋɔ.› Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é boga. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4"/>À mina ɠɛ ga wo-mɛmɛwolani kɛʋele, niiti GALA goo wo nu mɔungiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: À zeɠe wo-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔiti ta wo-zɔ ɲɔiti polu.› Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa woilo gòo ma, ti la gòo zoni,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5"/>«Mini ɠa za wo-mɛmɛwolani ti ná? GALA goo wo nuiti ɓalaa ti yɛgɛ vulua eyɛsu ɠɔ ɓaa? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6"/>Kɛlɛ tama, dàawooiti, ta nà-deveiti gè ti veeni nà-botiɠɛ nuiti, GALA goo wo nuiti zea, naati ti wo-mɛmɛwolani kɔɠɔzumɛɛnni. Ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavaliboni, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii gi zogɛ ʋelei é deveni la, é zoloo gi ziɛ ʋeleiti ta gi-zɔgiti ma.› »<verse eid="ZEC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai ma mɔungi: Soo ɓulugi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7"/>Masagi Daliyuse ná-konagi velesiɛi ma, alu puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11) daa ga Seeɓate, naa ná-folo ʋuufele maazu naanigɔi (24) ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Zakali ʋɔ, Ɓelekia ná-doun zunui, é ga Ido ná-doun zunui ɓalaa: <verse eid="ZEC 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8"/>Naama ɓidii gè kulakɛlɛmai ta ɠaani. Gè zunu ɠila kaani zeini soo maaɓɔikpɔigi ɠɔma, é ɠɛni loni milɛte guluiti saama pɛtu kpomaʋɛ. Soo maaɓɔikpɔigiti, ta soo maalɛitɛigiti, ta soo ɠolegiti ti ɠɛni loni poluʋelei. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9"/>Gè gaazaɠani, gè ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, lee ma zoo ɠa ga niiti?» Geezuɠeelai nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, naa ɠɛni mà: «Nà ʋaazu ti-ʋaaɠulabai lɛɛzu ga ɗe.» <verse eid="ZEC 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10"/>Zunui nii é ɠɛni loni milɛtegiti saama, naa ɠɛ ma: «Niiti ka Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti leʋegai ga ti eteai zuɓizɛ.» <verse eid="ZEC 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11"/>Soo ɓizɛ nuiti ti ʋoluvaawoni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ma, é ɠɛni loni milɛtegiti saama, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi ɓega ga eteai zuɓizɛ, gi kaaʋɛ ga ziilɛigi, ta dooɠogi ɠa ná.»<verse eid="ZEC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, wɛlɛ, é ɠɛa ga kona ʋuulɔfela (70), è yiiɠaawanai Zeluzalɛme, ta Zuda laa wolaiti ma. Kɛni yeelɛ è ʋa ti maawɔinɠa?» <verse eid="ZEC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI iɲɔdɔɔ ɓɔɛiti ta gaanɛɛnɛ ɓɔɛiti boni naazu geezuɠeelai ma, nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14"/>Geezuɠeelai nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, naa devei veeni zèa ga gè niima ɠeela wooi laazeeli ga: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹Zìimaʋɛ laavegɛ ga nɛɛbɛi, Zeluzalɛme ta Siyɔn gizei ta-vaa zu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15"/>Kɛlɛ gola yiiɠaawanaʋɛ zooi naati ma, ti zei ʋele ɓɛtɛai ga pagɔ. Mazɔlɔɔ gè lago yiiɠaawanaʋɛ nɔ nà-nuɓusɛiti ma, kɛlɛ tiya mu ti ta ɓɔga naati ta-maanɔɠɔi ʋa.› <verse eid="ZEC 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà ɠalesu ma, gè Zeluzalɛme ɠaazumaawɔinɠa, nà-pɛlɛi ɠa lo ná ʋolu, pɛlɛ lo nui ná-kɔɠɔ galui ɠa la Zeluzalɛme ma.› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17"/>Geezuɠeelai ɠɛni mà: «Nii wo ʋolu, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: Nà-taa wolaiti ta ta-ɠulagaanɛɛzui zɔlɔɔ ʋolu, nà Siyɔn ɠaanɛɛnɛ, gè yiimazeɠe ʋolu ga Zeluzalɛme.› »<verse eid="ZEC 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai velesiɛi: <optbreak/> Minɛiti ta ɠain bo nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1"/>Gè ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, gè minɛ naanigɔ ɠaani kulakɛlɛmai taɠili su. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2"/>Gè ɠɛni geezuɠeelai ma, é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀: «Minɛi niiti ta ga leeni?» É gòoɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ mà: «Minɛi niiti ka ti Zuda zuvazagai, naa ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle ta Zeluzalɛme ʋa.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠain bo nu naanigɔ lɛɛni ga ze. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: «Leeni ɠa ti ʋaazu kɛɛzu?» É gòoɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ mà: «Ɠain bo nui niiti paaʋɛ ga ti zii ɠiligi naati kpɔlɔ, ti ti-minɛiti suɠale, tɛigiti ti-minɛiti buzeɠeai Zuda yooi laalɔɠɔma ga ti su nuɓusɛiti suvaza. Minɛiti ka ti Zuda ta Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛiti suvazagai ga kɛʋele ɲɔu, nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa zoosu unbuzeɠezu.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai zaʋasiɛi: Kɔɠɔ galui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5"/>Gè ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, gè zunu ɠila ka, kɔɠɔ galui zoni zea. <verse eid="ZEC 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6"/>Gè ɠɛ ma: «Mini ɠa è liizu ná?» É ɠɛ mà: «Nà liizu Zeluzalɛme ɠɔɠɔsu, gè sakpai, ta kogi ɠwɛɛ.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7"/>Geezuɠeelai nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, naa maaɓuɠani geezuɠeelai taɠili ba, nii é ɠɛni daaɠomisu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8"/>É ɠɛni naa ma: «Ɓizɛ, è ɓɔɛ zunu loungoi nu ʋɔ, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Zeluzalɛme ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga taai, siɠi nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa ma, tɔɔzei nuɓusɛiti ta toganiiti mɔin ʋelei ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛɛzu ná. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔi ɠa gè ɠɛɛzu maaɠoolii zu eɠɛ abu ziɠigi, gè ɠɛ ma taazuʋɛ ga ná-lɛbiyai,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kula zou ʋa nuiti toli fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10"/>«Ee! Ee! À ʋela!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Wo ɠula lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ yooi tɛi ba ga suvilɛ!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">«Mazɔlɔɔ gè wo zuvazagɛ geeɠɔlɔgi wu ʋepema naanigɔi pɛ,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11"/>«Ee, Siyɔn nuɓusɛiti, à ʋela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:11">wɔi wo zeini Ɓaɓilɔne taazuʋɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">‹Tɛigi é tèʋegai ga ná-zobogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">zooi naati daalɔɠɔma niiti ti loai wo ma, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">Zɔi nɔpɛ é vɔɔɠuzu wo ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">naama nui vɔɔɠua gàazuleegi ʋa.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13"/>Wɛlɛ, nà yeewuzeɠezu zooi naati daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">ta latisu ti ɠɛ ga ta-luɔiti zeezu ani.› »</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">Wa kwɛɛ naazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii tèʋegɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:14"/>«Wa ʋe de, Siyɔn nuɓusɛiti, à ɠoozunɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">Wo wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">mazɔlɔɔ nà ga ʋa gè zei wo zaama,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:15"/>«Naama volo ná, zii ɠiligi ma mɔinmɔin ka ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">ti ɠili Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">Ta ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">nà zei wo zaama.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">Wa kwɛɛ naazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é tèʋegai wo ma.<verse eid="ZEC 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Zuda zeɠe ʋolu ga nɔnɔi, zou ɲadegai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:16">É yiimazeɠe ʋolu ga Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="ZEC 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:17"/>Eteai pɛ ge maaɠɛ kpɔ mu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:17">Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa na ɠula ga suvilɛ sei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu.<verse eid="ZEC 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai naanisiɛi: <optbreak/> Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1"/>É zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe lɛɛni ga ze, é loni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠakala, Setana ɠɛni loni Zozuwe yeezazu ʋelei, é ɗa maalɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni Setana ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zelilo è ma faan, Setana! Gaamazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zelilo è ma, tɛigi é yiimazeɠeai ga Zeluzalɛme! Zunui nii la ga koʋileʋegi kulaai abui ɠa ɓaa?»<verse eid="ZEC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3"/>Zozuwe ɠɛni loni geezuɠeelai ɠakala, maaɠiliai ga seɠe nɔɠɔiti. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4"/>Naa ɠɛni nuiti ma, ti ɠɛni loni koba: «À seɠe nɔɠɔiti kula kɔba.» Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni Zozuwe ma: «Wɛlɛ gè ɗa-vaaɠaaza golai zeɠea è ʋa, nà è maaɠilizu ga seɠe ʋapagiti.» <verse eid="ZEC 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: «Ti bɔɔlɔ pagɔi lɔ unba.» Tama ti bɔɔlɔ pagɔi lɔɔni unba, ti maaɠili ga seɠe ɲadegaiti. Miná ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni loni ná.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai niima zeele wooi woni Zozuwe ma, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ZEC 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹Ni ɗa ziɛna ga zìima ʋeleiti, è nà-deveiti so, ɗa ɠɛ ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui nà-pɛlɛi wu, ɗa ɠɛ wɛlɛzu ma ɠoizuʋɛ pɛ ma, nà pele vie è luɠɔ. Ɗa ɠɛ ʋɛ, naati saama, ti botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ̀.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8"/>« ‹À woilo, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai, Zozuwe, wa è-wɔɔlaiti ti zeini è ɠoba, tɔɔzei wo pɛ wa ga poogi, mazɔlɔɔ nà ʋaazu ga nà-botiɠɛ nui nii daaseigi ga: Ma Ʋɔnɔgi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9"/>Wɛlɛ gè kɔtu ɠila pilɛga Zozuwe luɠɔ. Kɔtu ɠila kpegi naa ɠaazuʋɛ ɠa ba ga dɔfela. Nà ɓɔɠɔi ɠa gè sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛzu ma. Nà zooi nii ná-kotoi zeɠe ba ga folo ɠila nɔ.› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10"/>« ‹Naama volo ná, wo ɠilagilagi kpein wa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ lolisu wa-leezɛn ɓeleiti ta kooleɠoole guluiti bu, wo ɗa ɠoozunɛ ná ziilɛigi zu.› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai lɔɔlusiɛi: <optbreak/> Fitina zei anii ta wolive wulu felegɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1"/>Geezuɠeelai nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, naa ʋaani ʋolu, é màaloɠa, ʋelei nu a ɗa ɲiimɛni nui maaloɠa la. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Leeni ɠa è kaazu?» Gè gooɠaaʋoteni, gè ɠɛ ma: «Fitina zei anii ɠa gè kaazu é ga zanugi nɔ ɲɛgɛlɛin, fitina lɔfela ɠa é zeini ga. Gulɔ aniɲakai zeini ti maazuʋɛ, sɔɔʋɛ lɔfelaiti togai ba, gulɔi ziɛzu ti zu, é zeeli fitinaiti su. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3"/>Wolive wulu felegɔ ɠa loni gulɔ aniɲakai ɠobaʋɛ, gilagi ɠa zeezazuʋɛ, zɔi ɠɛ ga kɔʋɛzu ʋelei.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4"/>Gè geezuɠeelai ɠaazaɠani ʋolu, nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, gè ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, nii ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga leeni?» <verse eid="ZEC 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5"/>Geezuɠeelai é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, é gàazaɠani é ɠɛ mà: «È la naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠwɛɛ?» Gè ɠɛ ma: «Ungo Màliɠii, gè la poluɠwɛɛ.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6"/>É gòoɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ mà: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa é bosu Zoloɓaɓɛle ma: È la niima wotii ɠɛa ga zobogi ta gaaɓaai, kɛni nà-zɛnvui zɛbɛi zu. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é boga.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7"/>Ɗa ga leeni kae, gize wolai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 4:7">Ɗa valibosu è ɠɛ ga nɛmɛi Zoloɓaɓɛle luɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 4:7">Toɠa kɔtu ɓiigi ɠula è zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 4:7">maamusɛ wooi zaama, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 4:7">‹Tuya ɠɔtui! Tuya ɠɔtui!› »<verse eid="ZEC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀ ʋolu, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9"/>«Zoloɓaɓɛle yeeiti ka ti niima wuulaagi laa, tiya ma nɔ ɠa ti pɛlɛi nii lo fai ɠaaɓelazu. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna wa kwɛɛ naazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é tèʋega wo ma. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10"/>Ɓɛɛni ka mu ti botii lɔɔzeizuʋɛ goi ʋaaɠulaai? Ti maa ɠɛni nɛɛni ga ti ɠoozunɛ, siɛgi zu ti kɔtu zaɠa ɠɔlui ɠaani la zoni Zoloɓaɓɛle ya. Kɔtu ɠaazu lɔfelaiti ta ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti, ti wɛlɛzu fai pɛ ma, ti ɠɛɛzu zooi ɠa.»<verse eid="ZEC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11"/>Gè gaazaɠani ʋolu, gè ɠɛ ma: «Wolive wulu felegɔi nuuti poluʋɛ ɠa ga leeni, ti loni fitina zei anii yeezazuʋɛ ta kɔʋɛzuʋɛ?» <verse eid="ZEC 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12"/>Gè ɠɛ ma mɔnɔ: «Wolive wulu ɓeke felegɔi nuuti poluʋɛ ɠa ga lee, ti loni zanu sɔɔʋɛ felegɔiti koba, niiti gulɔ ɓɛlɛi ziɛzu ti zu?» <verse eid="ZEC 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13"/>É ɠɛni mà: «È la ti ʋoluɠwɛɛ?» Gè ɠɛ ma: «Ungo Màliɠii, gè la ti ʋoluɠwɛɛni.» <verse eid="ZEC 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14"/>É polulɛɛni ga ze, é ɠɛ mà: «Zunu felegɔiti kana niiti gulɔi ziaai ti ma, ti losu eteai pɛ Maliɠii ɠakala.»<verse eid="ZEC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai lɔzitasiɛi: <optbreak/> Sɛʋɛ ɓiligi é ɠoʋesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1"/>Gè ɠaazuwuzeɠeni ʋolu, gè sɛʋɛ ɓiligi ɠa, é ɗa ɠoʋe. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2"/>Geezuɠeelai ɠɛ mà: «Leeni ɠa è kaazu?» Gè ɠɛ ma: «Sɛʋɛ ɓiligi ɠa gè kaazu, é ɗa ɠoʋe, sakpai ɠa ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ, kogi ga mɛtɛlɛ lɔɔlugɔ.» <verse eid="ZEC 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3"/>É ɠɛni mà: «Sɛʋɛi naa ɠa maanɔɠɔ vai zɛʋɛai su, nii é ʋaazu zeelizu zooi ɠɔlɔkɔlɔma ná pɛ. Bogɛ su ga unma nui pɛ ge ɓɛ, ti ɠula zooi nii ʋa, zɔiti ɓalaa ti zɛɛ zeele wooiti bosu, ta ɓɛ, ti ɠula ʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠa gè ʋaazu ga maanɔɠɔi naa, nii a kɛ é lɛ unma nui ná-pɛlɛi wu, ta zɔi é konai wosu ga dàaseigi zɛɛi maazu. Foovooi ɠa lɛ é zei ta-ʋɛlɛi wu, é pɛlɛi pɛ koloɠolo, é pɛɛ dakai ʋa ta kɔtuiti,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai lɔfelasiɛi: <optbreak/> Anzanui ɠɛni zeini kpɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5"/>Geezuɠeelai é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, é ɠɛni mà: «Ungi wuzeɠe è wɛlɛ naa ʋa, nii é ɠulazu munu.» <verse eid="ZEC 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: «Ɓɛgele ʋe?» É gòoɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ mà: «Kpɔlɔgi ʋe, é ɠulazu.» É ɠɛ mà mɔnɔ: «Kpɔlɔgi nuu ɠa é ga nuɓusɛiti koozu ɠisiɛi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nuɓusɛiti koozu ɠisiɛi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoi</char></note> zooi zu ná pɛ.» <verse eid="ZEC 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7"/>Naama ziɛgi zu kɔlui nii é ɠɛni ga kpɔlɔgi ma lakulugi, naa wuzeɠeni da, anzanu ɠila ka é ɠɛni zeini kpɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8"/>Geezuɠeelai ɠɛni mà: «Anzanui nuu ɠa é ga suɲɔulai ma ʋoogi.» Naa ʋoluma é zɔɔni naa ʋa, é yei kpɔlɔgi zu ʋolu, é daaɠulu ma.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9"/>Gè ɠaazuwuzeɠeni ʋolu, gè anzanu felegɔ ɠa, fiilɛi zeiɗai ti wu, ti ɗa ɠoʋe, koʋegi ɠɛni ti ʋa, eɠɛ wɔni daa ga sigɔɲe. Ti kpɔlɔgi zeɠeni, ti lɛɛ la fiilɛi zu. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10"/>Gè geezuɠeelai ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, gè ɠɛ ma: «Mini ɠa ti liizu ga kpɔlɔgi ná?» <verse eid="ZEC 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11"/>É ɠɛ mà: «Ta liizu la Ɓaɓilɔne yooi zu, ti kɔɔ ʋɛlɛi lo. À ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛna ta sei niina kɔɔ ɠɔtui maazu.»<verse eid="ZEC 5:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai lɔsaʋasiɛi: Wotolo naanigɔiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1"/>Gè ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, gè soo wotolo naanigɔ ɠa, ti ɗa ɠula kɔlu ɓɔi gize felegɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2"/>Soo maaɓɔikpɔigiti ka ti ɠɛni ma mɔungi ʋa, soo lɛigiti ti ɠɛ felesiɛi ʋa. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3"/>Soo ɠolegiti ti ɠɛ saʋasiɛi ʋa, soo ʋɔnɛgiti ti zuɓaai ti ɠɛni naanisiɛi ʋa. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4"/>Gè geezuɠeelai ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, gè ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, lee zoo ɠa ga nuuti?» <verse eid="ZEC 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5"/>É gòoɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ mà: «Fiilɛ naanigɔiti be, ti ɠɛa loni eteai Maliɠii ɠobaʋɛ, ti ɠulazu ná niina, ti ɗa li.» <verse eid="ZEC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6"/>Soo lɛigi niiti ti ɠɛni wotoloi gilagi ʋa, naati ti liini ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei yooi zu, naa ʋolu soo ɠolegiti ɓalaa ti ɠulani, soo ʋɔnɛgiti ti liini ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei yooi zu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7"/>Soo zuɓaagiti pɛ ti ɠulani, wɔin wola ɠɛni ti ma ga ti eteai ɠɔlɔkɔlɔmaʋɛ pɛ suɓizɛ. É ɠɛni ti ma: «À liina wo eteai ɠɔlɔkɔlɔmaʋɛ pɛ suɓizɛ.» Tama ti eteai ɠɔlɔkɔlɔmaʋɛ pɛ suɓizɛni. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8"/>É tòlini, é ɠɛ mà: «Wɛlɛna zɔiti ti liizu lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, naati ta ziilɛigi ve Zɛ̀nvui ʋɛ naama yooi zu.»<verse eid="ZEC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masa bɔɔlɔgi lɔɔ vai <optbreak/> zalaɠa ɠula nui Zozuwe unma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="ZEC 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10"/>«Yeezei kula zou ʋa nuiti ta-vebɛaniiti bu, nii Ɠɛledayi, ta Toɓiya ta Yedaya ti ʋaai la. Liina za nɔ Sofoni ná-doun zunui Zoziase ná-pɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ nui niiti ti laayeiɗai ná, ti zeɠeai ma Ɓaɓilɔne. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11"/>Ɗa walii ta zanugi zeɠezu, è ti ɓɛtɛ ga masa bɔɔlɔgi, è dɔ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe unma, Yewosadake ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12"/>Ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:12">Zunui ta ɠa ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:12">daaseigi ga Ma Ʋɔnɔgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:12">toɠa ʋɔnɔ ʋɛ é ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:12">é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo.<verse eid="ZEC 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13"/>Tɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠa é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi losu ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:13">Maa ɠa ɠili ga masa sɔɔlaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:13">é masadai ɠɛ ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:13">Toɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui ɓalaa ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 6:13">Goolaama ʋagɔi ɠa ɠɛ boti felegɔi naati zɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="ZEC 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14"/>« ‹Masa bɔɔlɔgi ɠa makɛsu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsu anii Ɠelɛme vaa ma, ta Toɓiya ta Yedaya, naa ʋɛɛ Sofoni ná-doun zunui ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ʋa.<verse eid="ZEC 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15"/>« ‹Numaa ta ɠɛ zeɠezu ɠoozama, ti ʋa, ti kpɔbai wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu. Wa kwɛɛ naazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é tèʋegai wo ma. Naa ɠa ɠɛ nɔ ti, ni wa ɠolona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ʋɛ, wa-ƓALAGI.› »<verse eid="ZEC 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7"/>
  <para style="s">Zu so kuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1"/>Masagi Daliyuse ná-masadai ma ɠonagi naanisiɛi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Zakali ʋɔ, alugi laaʋuusiɛi daa ga Kiselɛve naa ma volo naanigɔi ma. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2"/>Ɓetɛle nuɓusɛiti ti Salɛsɛɛl ta Legɛme-Melɛkeni teʋeni, é ɓɔ numaa ʋa, ga ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3"/>ti zeeli zalaɠa ɠula nuiti pɔ bɛ, niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-pɛlɛi wu, ta GALA goo wo nuiti pɔ bɛ, ti naati gaazaɠa ga: «Gá yɛsu gɔlɔi nɔ ɠa ɠɔ, gi ɗa zugi zo konagi ma alugi lɔɔlusiɛi ma, ʋelei gi ɠɛa kɛɛzu la pɔlɔma?»<verse eid="ZEC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɓɔɛni pɔ̀ naazu, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="ZEC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5"/>«Ɠɛ zooi zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ ma, ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti: ‹Wo kɛa ga kona ʋuulɔfela (70), wo ɗa zugi zo, wo ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawɔin konagi ma alugi lɔɔlusiɛi ta dɔfelasiɛi ma, kɛlɛ wo la naa ɠɛɛni bɛ̀. <verse eid="ZEC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6"/>Wo ɠɛni daami wosu, ta kpɔɔlei, wo-ɠogiti sulaave fai nɔ ma.› »<verse eid="ZEC 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7"/>Niima woo ɠilagiti nɔ lɛi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ʋuuni GALA goo wo nu mɔungiti da, ti bo siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni zeini la ziilɛigi zu Zeluzalɛme, ta taaiti ti maaɠoolii zu, ta siɛgi zu ɓalaa lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ yooi zu, ta ziɛlaʋɛ ma nɛmɛiti ti laaveni da ga nuɓusɛiti.<verse eid="ZEC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Zakali ʋɔ ɠani: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: À ɗa tukpɔiti gaaleʋe ga gaamai, wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ge ɗa wooɠɛɠiladai ta gaazumaawɔinɠai ɠɛ bɔɔlai ʋɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10"/>À mina ɗa ga poanzaiti, ta podointi suziɠa, ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti, ta niiti kpein ti kpalaiti su. Wo tanɔpɛ ge mina faa ɲɔu ɓɛtɛ bɔɔlaiti daalɔɠɔma.» <verse eid="ZEC 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa woilo naama wooiti ma, ti ɓakani, ti ti-woiyeɠeiti daaɠulu ga ti mina faa mɛni. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12"/>Ti ɠikpaani kpaan eɠɛ diamai, nii a kɛ ti mina yeezei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-tɔgiti, ta daawooiti bu, niiti ná-Zɛnvui ɠɛni bosu GALA goo wo nu mɔungiti ma. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wola yiiɠaawanani naazu. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: «Tɛi gè ti lolini, ti la woiloni gòo ma, tiya ɓalaa ta tòlina, gè la woiloga ti-woo ma. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14"/>Gè ti vazani zii ɠiligiti saama, niiti ti la ɠɛni ti ɠwɛɛ kaipa. Ti ta-yooi zuɲakai yɛ ga ʋoluʋelei, ʋɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni lɛɛzu ná, é ʋa ɗa yei. Ti zou ʋapagi valiboni ga teʋebai.»<verse eid="ZEC 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme lo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɓɔɛni ɠani: <verse eid="ZEC 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:2">‹Siyɔn nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀, ma yii wola ɠa bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:2">gaamazu, nà ɠalazu su ga ná-maayogi.›<verse eid="ZEC 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:3">‹Nà ɠalesu ma Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:3">sèizuʋɛ ɠa ɠɛ ga Zeluzalɛme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:3">Zeluzalɛme ɠa loli ga: Wooɠɛɠila taai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:3">ta ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-gizei ma: Gize ɲadegai.›<verse eid="ZEC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:4">‹Nu wɔlɔzaɠagiti ta zeizu mɔnɔ Zeluzalɛme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:4">zunuiti ta anzanuiti ta zei koi zaamaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:4">ɛsɛ pɛ ná-tukpɔ zea, tɔɔzei ma nu ná-konagi mɔin ʋelei ʋa.<verse eid="ZEC 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5"/>Zeluzalɛme koi zaamaʋɛti daa ɠa ve</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:5">ga zunu loungoiti ta anzanu loungoiti, ti ɗa ɠaɠo.›<verse eid="ZEC 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:6">‹Ni nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ta kaazu ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:6">niima vaiti ti la zooga ɠɛɛzu niima voloiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:6">anɠɛ nɛi nà ɓalaagi nà ɠisiɛzu ga naati ti la zooga ɠɛɛzu?› »</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:6">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:7">‹Nà nà-nuɓusɛiti kizosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:7">gè ti ɠula folo ɠulazu ʋele yooi ta folo liizu ʋele yooiti su.<verse eid="ZEC 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8"/>Nà ʋa ga tiye ti ɠula ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">ti zei Zeluzalɛme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">Ta ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">gè ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:8">nà masadai ɠɛ ti unda ga wooɠɛɠiladai ta telebogi.›<verse eid="ZEC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">‹À zɛbɛzeɠe, wɔigi wo niima wooiti mɛnisu niizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">nii GALA goo wo nuiti ti ɠɛni bosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma wuulaagiti ti ɠɛni laazu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:9">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi naa lo fai zu.<verse eid="ZEC 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, aisa naama voloiti ti ʋa zeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">nuɓusɛiti ta toganiiti ti la ɠɛni ta-wotii ma zala zɔlɔɔsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">Siɛ wo nui niiti ti ɠɛni lɛɛzu, ti ɗa yei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">naati ti ɠɛni nɔ ga ti zili nuiti tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">mazɔlɔɔ gè yeeɓeni nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:10">ti ɗa wuzeɠe ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="ZEC 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11"/>Kɛlɛ niizu niina, gè la mɔ nuɓusɛi mɔtai zosu ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:11">ʋelei gè ɠɛni kɛɛzu la mɔungi.› »</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:11">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12"/>« ‹Mazɔlɔɔ, nà ziilɛigi vaza wo zaama, eɠɛ ani zuwui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">Leezɛn ɓelei ɠa gaawaai ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">zooi ɠa baalɔnɔgi ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ɓe tonai ʋa, é ʋu ga gola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">Nà niima vaaɓɔɠɔi pɛ kɛɛzu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:12">nà-nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti bɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13"/>Ee, Zuda ta Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">mɔungi wo ɠɛni zii ɠiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">ga nuɓusɛiti ti voovoai, naati ma ʋoogi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">Ʋele nɔ ɠana gè wo ɠizosu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">wo ɠɛ ga tuya ɗɛungi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:13">Naa ɠa é ba mu, à mina lua, à zɛbɛzeɠe ʋolu.› »<verse eid="ZEC 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:14">‹Siɛgi zu gè devea la ga gè wo ɓɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:14">tɔɔzei wo-mɛmɛwolani ti zìiɠaawanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:14">gè la ɠɛni zeɠeni gòoi ʋolu.<verse eid="ZEC 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15"/>Niizu niina, gè zeɠea naama levei ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:15">nà faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛzu niina Zeluzalɛme ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:15">ta Zuda nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:15">À mina lua mu.<verse eid="ZEC 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16"/>« ‹Pɛtɛ ʋele ɠa wa faiti kɛɛ la: Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɗa gaamai wo bɔɔlai ma, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ti ɗa tukpɔɠaaleʋe ga telebogi, tukpɔɠaaleʋei nii ziilɛigi a zɔlɔɔ su. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17"/>Wo tanɔpɛ ge mina faa ɲɔu ɓɛtɛ yiimaʋɛ bɔɔlaiti daalɔɠɔma, à mina ɗa ga ɠona ga zɛɛi, tɔɔzei naama vai tanɔpɛ bɛlɛ la bɛ̀,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zu so foloiti ta valibo ga fɛti voloiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="ZEC 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹Zugi nii wo sosu, alugi naanisiɛi, dɔɔlusiɛi, dɔfelasiɛi ta puusiɛi konagi zu, ta valibo ga koozunɛ voloi, ta fɛti voloiti Zuda nuɓusɛiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 8:19">« ‹Naa ma, à gaamai ta ziilɛigi nɛɛ ʋɛ.›<verse eid="ZEC 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:20">‹Zou ɠili su nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:20">ta taa wolaiti su zei wo nu mɔinmɔin ga ta ʋa mɔnɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21"/>Taa wolaiti su nuɓusɛiti ta li ti ɠɛ taɠiligaa ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:21">Ade li de Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii maanɛɛnɛ, de gaiziɛ. Nà ɓalaagi nà liizu.<verse eid="ZEC 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22"/>Ʋele ɠana nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin, ta zeeɠaaɓaa yooiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:22">ta ʋaa la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠaiziɛzu la, ti maanɛɛnɛ.›<verse eid="ZEC 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">‹Naama voloiti nu puugɔ ti tanɔpɛ ti la ga zii ɠila ta ɠaalɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">ti Zuifu ɠila so ná-seɠei lakɔlɔgi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">ti ɠɛ ma: Gá ʋilɛsu wo ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 8:23">mazɔlɔɔ gi mɛnigɛ ga GALA ka wo ʋa.› »<verse eid="ZEC 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ɠoba yooiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai <optbreak/> ta ti ɠizo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-keela wooi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 9:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Daawooi Ɠadelake yooi zoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">é ɠwɛ Damase taazuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Mazɔlɔɔ nu vului pɛ ka ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">ʋelei nɔ Izilayɛle wolodaiti pɛ ti la.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2"/>É Ɠamate ɓalaa zoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">niiti ti zeiɗai la ta Damase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">é zeeli Tiil, ta Sidɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">niiti ti wola ɠoozuɠeleai.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3"/>Tiil siɠi gaaɠooza toga ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">é walii ɠaalɛa ba eɠɛ fufiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">é zanugi ɠaalɛ ba eɠɛ koi yɔɠɔzu ʋalaʋalagi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4"/>Kɛlɛ Maliɠii ɠa ti pɛ kula zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">toɠa ná-siɠigiti toka kpoloɗɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">toɠa ɠala ga abui.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5"/>Asekalɔn ɠa naa ɠa, é lua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza ɓalaa zu ɠa ɓali ga duai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Ekelɔn ɓalaa ka ɠɛ ɠana nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">tɔɔzei kitosuʋɛ ɠa ɠula zea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Masa ge la mɔ ɠɛa Gaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">nu vulu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa Asekalɔn.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6"/>Nu zupuiti ta zei Asadɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:6">Nà Filisiti nuiti ta-wasogi zuɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7"/>Nà ɲamasu zuai ɠula ti-la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">gè kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ laamianigiti kula ti-ɲiiga yɔɠɔzuʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ta-nuɓusɛi mɔtai ɠa ɠɛ ga gá-ƓALAGI nɔnɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Toɠa losu zɔlɔɔ Zuda wolodamaiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ekelɔn nuiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛ ga Yeɓuse nuiti kɛʋele.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8"/>Nà ɠɛ nà-zooi maaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">gè makɛ kɔɔɓɔgiti daalɔɠɔma, ti leʋesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">suɲɔu nui tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ nà-nuɓusɛiti kpɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">mazɔlɔɔ gàazu ɠa ɠɛ ti ʋa niina.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ziilɛi masagi ʋaa vai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9"/>Ee, Siyɔn nuɓusɛi, ɠɔkɔ ga koozunɛɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ee, Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛi, wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Wɛlɛ ɗa-masagi ʋa, é ʋaazu è ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">telebogɛ, pilɛ sɔlɔɔdai veeʋɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">toɠa ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nu, é zeini soovalegi ɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">soovale saai ma yiʋoi ɠɔma.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10"/>Nà kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti kulazu Efelayime ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">gè kɔɔɠɔ zooiti kula Zeluzalɛme ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">mɛɛin nii kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu la, naa zu ɠa ɠaleɠale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Masagi naa ɠa ziilɛigi lɔ zii ɠiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">ná-masadai ɠa zo kpoloɗɛi zɔi ma, é zei zɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">é zo ziɛ wolai Efelata ma, é li zou ɓela ga.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duɔiti unmɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11"/>Ɗɔun ɗɔnɔi, minazeɠegi maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">é de yɔɠɔzu, nii kɛai ga ɲamai maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">nà ɗa-luɔiti unmɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">gè ti ɠula zeɠei zu, nii ziɛ la su.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12"/>Kasoɠa nuiti wɔiti kitogi wo ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">à ɠale ma wa-laazu ziɠi gaaɠoozagi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">Nà nii wosu za ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">Nà wo ɠaazumaawɔinɠa ga seizu felegɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè Zuda ɠɛa ga nà-mɛɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">gè Efelayime ɠɛ ga ná-mɛɛn ɠaei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Ee, Siyɔn, nà è-loun zunuiti teʋesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">ti vala ɗɔnɔ ma loun zunuiti ba Yavan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">nà è ɠɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ woɠa zɔkpɔi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɠula kɛlɛma ti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">ná-mɛɛin ɠa ɓizɛ eɠɛ mainmain.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI puʋugi vɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">toɠa ʋaazu lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazu lonavifigi wu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa ɓaa ná-nuiti maazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">Ta daami wo, ti fɛlɛvɛlɛ kɔtuiti golowolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">Ta ɓɔɔle, ti ɗa zɔngɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">eɠɛ dɔɔ ɠa ti zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">ti laa ɠa ve eɠɛ ɲama vaza aniɲakai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">ti maa ɠa ɓɔɔle eɠɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma woizuʋɛti.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16"/>Ta-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠa ná-nuɓusɛiti kizo naama voloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">eɠɛʋelei nɔ baala makɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">a ɗa ná-baala kpulugi ɠizo da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">ti ɗa volo ná-zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">ʋelei kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaaɓaagiti ta ɗa volo la masa bɔɔlɔgi ma.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17"/>Ee, ti wola undaa ɠa nɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">Ee, ta ʋapa ga gola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">Moloi ɠa zɛbɛi ve zunu loungoiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">dɔɔ niinɛi zɛbɛi ve anzalopoiti zea.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tosu nɔpɛ ge la kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vali ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">é yeeɠɛɠala mɔungi ma lonai ʋu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">Tɔ ɠa a ɗa sabalagiti pu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">toɠa tonai ve ga pooʋama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">toɠa ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-kpalaga aniiti kpɛtɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ pɛlɛ wu zaleiti ta wo wooɠaaʋotesu ga zɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">ungaiziɛ nuiti ti ɗa zɛɛ ɠulakɛlɛmaiti ka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">kɛzɛsulala ze gooiti ka ti suɠulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">yaava ɠaanɛɛnɛi ɠa ti bosu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Naa ɠa é kɛa nuɓusɛiti ti lia poun maanɔɠɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">eɠɛ baala kpulugiti makɛ nu la ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Unmɔɔgi ma minazeɠegi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3"/>«Baala makɛ nuiti ka zìiɠaawanaai ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">boli zinɛiti ka gè ti loɠazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa ɠaaɓaazu tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-baala kpulugi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">nii é ga Zuda ʋɛlɛyeɠei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Toɠa ti ɠɛɛzu ga ná-lɛbiya zooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">é liizu la kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4"/>Tɔ ɠa kundiɠii ma zii pɛ ka ɠula su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">ti ɠɛai eɠɛ sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">eɠɛ seɠe ɠotai ma zuzo kɔlui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">eɠɛ kɔɔɠɔ mɛɛin.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5"/>Ta ɠɛ eɠɛ kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, ta kɔɔi ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">ti ɗa koi yɔɠɔzu ʋalaʋalagi ɠaayɔ ga ɠɔɠɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɠɛɛzu ti ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">Unfegi ɠa yei ga ti zili nuiti, ti sooiti kɔma.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6"/>«Nà Zuda ʋɛlɛyeɠei zɛbɛlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">gè Zozɛfe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠizo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Nà ti zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu ga niinɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">tɔɔzei nà ti maawɔinɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">eɠɛ vɔlɔ kaipa gè la ɠɛni ɠɛlɛni ti ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">nà ta-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti gaaʋote.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7"/>Zɛbɛi ɠa ɠɛ Efelayime nuiti ba eɠɛ kɔɔɠuluɓaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">ti laa ɠa ve ga koozunɛɛi, eɠɛ ta dɔɔ ɓɔle.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">Siɛgi zu ti-lointi ta miná ɠaa la, ti ɠoozu ɠa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">ti ɠoozu ɠa nɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maaʋele.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8"/>Nà ti loli ga foe wooi ti ɠaalɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">mazɔlɔɔ gè ti unmɔɔga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">Ta mɔin ga mɔungi ɠɛʋele.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9"/>Gè ti zuvazagɛ zɔɔma ziiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">zooiti su ti maaɠoozaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">ti-ɠi ka loo sù miná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">ta yɛ ná ta ti-lointi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">naa ʋoluma ti ɠale ma, ti ʋa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10"/>Nà ti ɠula Ezipete yooi zu, ta Asiili yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">gè ʋa ga tiye Galaade, ta Liɓan yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">kɛlɛ miná ɓalaa ge la kula ɠɛa ti ʋa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ta kidaaʋili kpoloɗɛi ɓudɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa kpoloɗɛi ma lakpatakpagi loɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">ziɛ wolai Nile ɠa vɔ, é zeeli kpoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asiili ná-wasogi zu ɠa ɠale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Ezipete ná-masa tukpɔi ɠa ɠula zea.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">nà zɛbɛi ve Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">ti ziɛ ga zìimai,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11"/>
  <para style="s">GALA zobobɛ nuiti koloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1"/>Liɓan, ɗa-laaiti daalao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:1">abui ʋa é ɗa-sɛdele guluiti gala.<verse eid="ZEC 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2"/>Sipɛlɛ guluiti, à ɓalakpala ɠoozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">tɔɔzei sɛdelegi loa bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">mazɔlɔɔ gulu maanɛɛnɛgiti ti ʋɔga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">À ɓalakpala Ɓasan sɛne guluiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">mazɔlɔɔ goya wolai ɠoloa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">nii nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa lɔɔzu ba!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3"/>Nu ɠa baala makɛ nuiti kpala gooi mɛnisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">mazɔlɔɔ tufa lɛnugi ti ɠɛa wokomaalɛɛzu la naa ɠoloɠologa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Nu ɠa zalaiti sikɔ wooi mɛnisu ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">mazɔlɔɔ Zuludɛn ma lɔɓɔ ɓiili wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">ti ɠɛa wokomaalɛɛzu la naa ɠoloa.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baala makɛ nu zeizu felegɔiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4"/>Nà-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: «Ɠɛ ga baalagi tɛiti makɛ nui, niiti ti leveai na saai ma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5"/>Tɛigiti ti ti ɠeyazu, ti ɗa ti ʋaa wafuun, ti ʋɔdi nuiti ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ gè ɓɛtɛa!› Ti makɛ nu ɓɔɠɔiti ti la vɔlɔ ti maawɔinɠaazu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6"/>Gè la mɔ zooi nii zu nuɓusɛiti maawɔinɠaa pɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ nà nuiti zɛsu ɓɔɠɔ yeezu, tanigaa ti ɗa ti-waiti suziɠa, gè ti yɛ ta-masagiti zeezu. Ta-masagiti ta zooi ɠoloɠolo, kɛlɛ gè la nu nɔpɛ kula ti ya,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7"/>Gè tɔɔzeini ga baalagi naati makɛga, niiti ti leveai na saai ma, ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga zɔiti ti maawɔinni baala kpulugi zaama. Gè baala makɛ tukpɔ felegɔ vaaɠɛɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ. Gè ma mɔungi laasei pɛɛ ga «Zaalai», gè felesiɛi laasei pɛ ga «Gilibai». Gè zɛba gè ɗa ɠaaɓa baalagiti ma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8"/>Alu gilagi laawu, gè makɛ nu saʋagɔiti kpɛɛni. Naa ʋoluma, zìi la ɠɛni lɔɔni baalagiti bu, tiya ɓalaagi wɔ̀inzeɠe ti ma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9"/>Gè ɠɛni baalagiti ma: «Gè la mɔ wo ɠɔnɔkula pɛ! Zɔi é zaazu, naa za! Zɔi ta ɠɛ paazu, naa ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ná, ti paa! Zɔiti ta yɛ vulua, naati ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ mi yɔɠɔzu.» <verse eid="ZEC 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10"/>Gè nà-tukpɔi zoni, nii daa ga «Zaalai», gè galeɠale, naa ɠɛ ga nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa, nii é ɠɛa gi yɔɠɔzu gá ziiti pɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11"/>Minazeɠegi naa ɠoloɠoloni naama voloi nɔ. Baalagi niiti ti wola maawɔinɗai, ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu bà, naati ti kwɛɛni ga, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ɓɔɛzu ga niima vaiti maaʋele. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12"/>Gè ɠɛni ti ma: «Ni wa kaana ga soloo faa ʋe, a sàlai ve zèa, ɓaa wo zɛ ná.» Ti wali ɠae ʋuusaʋagɔi (30) ɠaaluni, ti fe ga sàlai. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Walii é ti ɠaazu ga ma ʋagɔi, naa ʋili ya pɔlɔ liɠi lo nui ma, nii ti kaai ga nɔ̀un sɔngɔi.» Gè wali ɠae ʋuusaʋagɔi (30) zeɠeni, gè pili ya Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, pɔlɔ liɠi lo nui ma vaa ma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14"/>Naa ʋoluma gè nà-tukpɔi velesiɛi «Gilibai» ɠaleɠaleni, naa ɠɛ ga kɛɛɠɛlounlai ɠoloɠologa Zuda ta Izilayɛle yɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni mà: «Ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili niina ga baala makɛ nui ná-sɔɔlaiti, nii é ɠɛɛzu ga ɠimalala nui. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà baala makɛ nu ɠila buzeɠezu zooi nii zu, nii é la yiizoolɛa ga baalagiti, ti ɠɛɛzu ti za, é la baala goiti gaiziaa, nii maawanaai é la naa ʋaloa, nii kɛdɛgai é la naa ɠɔnɔkula. Kɔnɔgi ɠa ɠɛ ga togani niiti ti wulɔai naati ma zuaiti, é ɗa ti-ʋolokagiti baliʋali.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17"/>Maanɔɠɔ ɠa ɠimalala ʋaala makɛ nui ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">é ɠɛlɛzu ná-baala kpulugi ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Tɛigi boɠa zɔkpɔi zeei zu vikɛi ɠoloɠolosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">ta é zeezazu ʋele ɠaazuɠɛzɛi wolo su!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Zeei za ma faan, ta zeezazu ʋele ɠaazuɠɛzɛi za su faan!<verse eid="ZEC 11:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12"/>
  <para style="s">Masagi ná-zobo sɔlɔɔda ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-keela wooi daazeeliai Izilayɛle ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa, tɛigi é geeɠɔlɔgi zɛlɛgai, é zooi la, é lati é nu vului yɛnvui ɓɛtɛ su:<verse eid="ZEC 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2"/>«Nà Zeluzalɛme ɠɛɛzu ga gaazulati dɔɔ ʋɛɛlɛi, nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ, ti maaɠoolii zu. Ʋele nɔ ɠana é ɠɛɛzu la ga Zuda, siɛgi zu Zeluzalɛme zeizu la kɛlɛ su. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3"/>Naama volo ná, nà Zeluzalɛme losu gbiɠi nuɓusɛiti pɛ tuɠɔ, eɠɛ kɔtu wolai nii nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga buzeɠezu. Zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠɛ é buzeɠe, naa ɠa ɓɔɠɔ maawana. Názu eteai zu yooiti kpein ta ɓɔsu, ti wuzeɠe daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4"/>Naama volo ná, nà ta-zooiti doɠa ga dualuagi, gè ta-zoo ɓizɛ nuiti doɠa ga titigi,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. «Kɛlɛ nà ɓaa Zuda nuɓusɛiti maazu, gè zii ɠiligiti ta-zooiti gaazuɠole. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5"/>Zuda ɠundiɠiiti ta ɠɛ bosu yiimaʋɛ ga: ‹Zeluzalɛme nuiti ta ti-zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔsu ta-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii.› <verse eid="ZEC 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6"/>Naama volo ná, nà Zuda ɠundiɠiiti kɛ ga abu ɓɔi golai nii é dɔɓɔi ʋa, gè ti ɠɛ ga sɔmɔ abui, é zosu molo ɠiliiti ba, ta ti-maaɠoolii zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ gala mɛtu ʋepemaʋɛ pɛ. Kɛlɛ Zeluzalɛme zei wo nuiti ta yɛ ti-zeizuʋɛ nɔ ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa tɔɔzeizu dɛ ga Zuda nuɓusɛiti kizoga, naa ɠa a kɛ Davide mavofodaiti, ta Zeluzalɛme nuiti ti mina waso, ti ʋa ka ga ti vizɔgɛ Zuda nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ba. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8"/>Naama volo ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Zeluzalɛme zei wo nuiti makɛ, zɔi sɛbɛi wola ʋɛlɛai ti zaama, naa ɠa zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ ga Davide ɠɛʋele, Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠa ɠɛ ti ʋɛ eɠɛ GALA, eɠɛ vɔlɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai nii é ziɛzu ti luɠɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9"/>Naama volo ná, zooi niiti pɛ ta wuzeɠe Zeluzalɛme laalɔɠɔma, nà ti pɛ koloɠolo.»<verse eid="ZEC 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saa wɔlɔi é wosu zooi zu ná pɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10"/>«Nà maawɔinɠa yɛnvui, ta maanɛɛnɛ yɛnvui yei Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma, ta Zeluzalɛme nuiti ma. Ta ɠaazulo nɔ̀un ba, nɛ̀i ti bɔ̀ɔni. Ta wɔlɔ ná-faa zu, eɠɛʋelei nu a wɔlɔ la gila loin zaazuʋɛ. Ta ɓɔɠɔ maawɔin ga gaawana, eɠɛ nu a ʋala ná-doun mɔungi ma. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11"/>Naama volo ná, saa wɔlɔi ɠa wɔɔlɔ Zeluzalɛme, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛni la Ɠadadelimon, Megido ʋɛtugi zu. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12"/>Saa wɔlɔi ɠa wo zooi zu ná pɛ, pɛlɛyeɠe ɠilagilagi ɠa ʋu yɛ: Davide mavofodaiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɠa ʋu yɛ, ma anzaiti ti ʋu yɛ, Natan nɔnɔiti ti ʋu yɛ, ma anzaiti ti ʋu yɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13"/>Levi nɔnɔiti ti ʋu yɛ, ma anzaiti ti ʋu yɛ, Simeyi nɔnɔiti ti ʋu yɛ, ma anzaiti ti ʋu yɛ, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14"/>zɔɔma ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti ʋu yɛ ga gilagila, anzanuiti ɓalaa ti ʋu yɛ ga gilagila.»<verse eid="ZEC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ nuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1"/>Naama volo ná, ziɛungi laa ɠa lao Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ ta Zeluzalɛme nuiti bɛ, é ta-ɠotoiti ta ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti gba.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2"/>«Naama volo ná, nà kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti folo zooi ʋa, nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ti-laasei boga. Nà ma ɠala goo wo nuiti ɓalaa kula zooi ʋa, ta kɔzɔba ɠisiɛiti pɛ,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3"/>«Naazu, zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠɛɛzu GALA goo wosu, sɔlɔɔ kɛɛɠɛi, ta sɔlɔɔ deei ta ɠɛ ma: ‹È la mɔ yɛga vulua mazɔlɔɔ zɛɛ ɠala gooi ɠa è bosu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɔɠɔi zu.› Sɔlɔɔ nuiti ɓɔɠɔgo ɠa naazu ti bɔɔzu, siɛgi zu é ɠɛɛzu GALA gooi wosu da. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4"/>Naama volo ná, ma ɠala goo wo nuiti ti pɛ ti laa ɠa ve ga unfegi, siɛgi zu ti gala gooi wosu da, ti sɔlɔɔsu ta-ɠulakɛlɛmaiti su. Ti la mɔ kɛa pɛ, ti ʋa sua leɠa zeɠe wolai ta loo ɠɔba, ti ʋa ɗa nuiti yaava. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5"/>Ti ɠilagilagi a ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè la ga GALA goo wo nu, nà ga tii ɠɛɛ nu nɔ, tii ɠɛ yooiti ta zèa kaite mà nu niinɛ ziɛ su.› <verse eid="ZEC 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6"/>Ni ta gaazaɠana, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹È palai niiti sɔlɔɔgɛ ɠale, ti è-ɠɔlɔgi ma?› Toɠa ti wooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè ti zɔlɔɔgɛ nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti ta-ʋɛlɛi wu.› »<verse eid="ZEC 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegi niinɛ vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7"/>«Boɠa zɔkpɔi wuzeɠe nà-baala makɛ nui laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi laalɔɠɔma!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">«Baala makɛ nui loɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">baalagiti ti zuvaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">nà ma goiti ɓalaa doɠa.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8"/>Zooi zu nuɓusɛiti gaa ɠa ɠwɛsu saʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">seizu felegɔi ɠa za, ti undaaʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">kɛlɛ seizu ɠilagi ɠa yɛ vulua zooi zu,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9"/>«Nà seizu ɠilagi naa lɔ abui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">gè gaawuun kɔzɔi ɠula ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">ʋelei nu a ɗa walii ɠaawuun da kɔzɔi ɠula ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">nà nɔɠɔi ɠula ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">ʋelei nu a ɗa zanugi ma ɠɔzɔi ɠula la ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Naazu ta fàli, gè ti wooɠaaʋote.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Nà ti loli ga: ‹Nà-nuɓusɛiti›.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Tiya ma, ta ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga gá-ƓALAGI!› »<verse eid="ZEC 13:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-foloi ta ɲɛpi ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1"/>Wɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-foloi ʋa é ʋaazu, foloi nii ta ɠɛ aniiti gaaɠwɛɛzu la ɗa-ziɠigi ɠoozu, niiti ti zogai kɔɔi zu è ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2"/>Nà zii ɠiligiti pɛ gaalɛ ba, ti kɔɔi vala Zeluzalɛme ʋa. Taai ɠa zo, toomai ɠa ɠɛ pɛlɛiti bu, puumai ɗa ɠɛ ga anzanuiti, nuɓusɛi ɠilazuʋɛ pɛ ka li duɔlai zu, kɛlɛ nuɓusɛi mɔta goi ɠa yɛ taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3"/>Naa ʋoluma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ʋa é kɔɔi ɠɔ zii ɠiligi naati daalɔɠɔma, ʋelei a ɗa kɛɛ la kɔɔɠɔ voloiti su. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4"/>Naama volo ná, toɠa lo Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma, nii é Zeluzalɛme ɠobaʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ɠa ʋali sakpa ma, é zo folo ɠulazu ʋelei é li folo liizu ʋelei, pɛtu golai ɠɛ ti yɔɠɔzu, gizei ɠilazuʋɛ ɠa likpi ga lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, gilazuʋɛ likpi ga lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5"/>Wa ʋela, wo li ga pɛtugi zu ʋelei, nii é nà-gizeiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ pɛtugi naa ɠa li é zei Asale ʋa. Wa ʋela ʋelei wo ɠɛni ʋelazu la zou ɓalii ʋa, Zuda masagi Woziase ná-siɛgi zu. Naa ʋoluma nà-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ʋa niina, ta ná-geezuɠeela ɲadegaiti pɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6"/>Naama volo ná, wozakala ge la mɔ ɠɛa ná, kɔɔlɛ la mɔ ɠɛa ná, ta ziɛ ɓuun ge la mɔ ɠɛa ná. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7"/>Foloi naa ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é nɔnɔ ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é kwɛɛ, folo la mɔ ɠɛa ná, ɓaa kpidi, anɛɛ kpɔkɔi wozakalagi ɠa volo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8"/>Naama volo ná, zɛnvu su ɗɛungi laa ɠa lao Zeluzalɛme, é ɗa yei, ma ɗɛi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠa yei ga folo ɠulazu ʋele ɓoloɗɛi ʋɔ pelei, gilazuʋɛ yei ga folo liizu ʋele ɓoloɗɛi ʋɔ pelei, ʋele ɠana a ɠɛ la foɠoi ta samai. <verse eid="ZEC 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛ eteai pɛ unda. Naama volo ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa a ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu, tɔ ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa tɔɠɔi a ɠula ɓalaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10"/>Zooi naa pɛ ka valibo ga nɛmɛi, é zo Geɓa é li Limon, Zeluzalɛme lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ. Zeluzalɛme ɠaa ɠa ɠooza koba laaiti pɛ ba, taai zu ɠa wɔɔlɔ, é zo Ɓɛnzamɛn Siɠidaʋɛ, é zeeli siɠida wɔlɔmai ma, é li Zokosu Siɠidaʋɛ, é zo mɔnɔ Ɠananeyɛle Ʋɛlɛ Ɠaaɠooza Golai ma, é zeeli masagi ná-kɔɠɛlaʋɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11"/>Sei ɠa wo taazuʋɛ, ani la mɔ ɠɛa ná nii foovoai, Zeluzalɛme ɠa zei ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12"/>Wɛlɛ maanɔɠɔi niiti ka Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a ti zei nuɓusɛi naati ma, niiti ti kɔɔi ɠɔai Zeluzalɛme laalɔɠɔma. Ta yɛ vulua ti-ɠɔlɔgi luula ti ma, ti-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti ti luula ti-ɠaazuɠokologiti su, ti-nɛgiti ti luula ti-laaɠoozuʋɛti. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13"/>Naama volo ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ti ɠɛ unga wuulee, ta ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ziɠazu ga ti-yeeɓuinti, ti dɔ ga kili ga kakaɲɛpi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14"/>Zuda nuiti ta ʋɔɔpɛɛ Zeluzalɛme ɲɛpi ʋa, ta naavoloi ɠula ti-maaɠoolii zu zii ɠiligiti zea, ta zanugi ɠaalɛ ba, naa ʋɛɛ walii ʋa, naa ɓɔ seɠe mɔinmɔin ba. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15"/>Maanɔɠɔi nii nɔ a zeeli nuɓusɛiti ma, naa ɠɛɠalai nɔ ɠa a zeeli zii ɠiligiti ta-loganiiti ma, ta ɠɛ kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, sooiti, soovale fuuluiti, soovalegiti, ta ɲɔmɛiti.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16"/>Naazu zii ɠiligi niiti kpein ti kɔɔi valaai Zeluzalɛme ʋa, ta-nuɓusɛi mɔtai niiti ta yɛ vulua naati ta ɗa lɛ kona-o-kona, ti nɔkɔ masagi wu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, ta ti kota vɛtii ɠula. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17"/>Kɛlɛ ni eteai zu ʋɛlɛyeɠei gila kpalaa ka ɠɛlɛna lɛɛzu Zeluzalɛme, é ʋa nɔkɔ masagi wu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, naama ʋɛlɛyeɠei la mɔ tona zɔlɔɔga. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18"/>Ni Ezipete nuiti ta ɠɛlɛna lɛɛzu Zeluzalɛme, ti ʋa kota vɛtii ɠula, maanɔɠɔi nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI daazu zii ɠiligi zɔiti ma, ti la lɛɛni fɛti ɠulazuʋɛ, naa ɠɛɠalai nɔ ɠa a zei ti ma. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19"/>Naa ɠa a ɠɛ ga Ezipete ta zii ɠiligi zɔiti ta-ɓakɔi a zeeli ti ma, tɛiti ti la lɛɛni kota vɛti ɠulazuʋɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20"/>Naama volo ná, ta sɛʋɛi ɠɛ sooiti kɔbu lalagiti ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Makɛgɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ». Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu liɠiiti ta ɲade, eɠɛ ɲama vaza aniɲakaiti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠakalaʋɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21"/>Zeluzalɛme, ta Zuda liɠiiti kpein ta ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, niiti kpein ta ɠɛ ʋaazu zalaɠa ɠula vai ma, naati ta ɗa ma liɠiiti seɠe, ti ɗa zalaɠa zuai ɠili ti zu. Naama volo ná, yaaɠo nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14"/>
</usx>
